0x1g ⇒ error 1:4: `g` is not a hexadecimal digit
0x_ff ⇒ error 1:3: a digit separator `_` must stand between two digits
πi ⇒ pi*i
xⁿ ⇒ error 1:2: unknown symbol `ⁿ`

# §3.3 Reserved names
