left + right ⇒ left + right
limit(f, x, 0, left) ⇒ limit(f, x, 0, left)
undefined ⇒ undefined
infinity ⇒ inf
true ⇒ true

# §3.4 Operators and punctuation
x<-1 ⇒ x < -1
x == 1 ⇒ error 1:3: write `=` for equals, not `==`
x =< 1 ⇒ error 1:3: write `<=`, not `=<`
x => 1 ⇒ error 1:3: write `>=`, not `=>`
x <> 1 ⇒ error 1:3: write `!=` for not equal, not `<>`
