x′ ⇒ error 1:1: `x'` needs an argument in brackets, as in `x'(x)`
2′ ⇒ error 1:2: `′` follows a number of degrees, as in `30°15′20″`

# §4.1 Precedence
5!! ⇒ factorial(factorial(5))
x²! ⇒ factorial(x^2)
2^3^2 ⇒ 2^(3^2)
2^3! ⇒ 2^factorial(3)
2^-1 ⇒ 2^(-1)
-2^2 ⇒ -(2^2)
sin x^2 ⇒ sin(x^2)
