(x, x) -> 1 ⇒ error 1:5: the parameters must be different names, as in `f(x, y) := x + y`
[after f(t) := t] [f(x -> x^2, 1)] ⇒ tree: ListExpr[Apply[f; Lambda[x; Power[Symbol x; Num 2]], Num 1]]
i -> i^2 ⇒ i -> i^2
pi -> 1 ⇒ error 1:1: `pi` is a constant, so it cannot be used as a name here

# §8.3 Definitions
a := 5 ⇒ a := 5
f(x) := x^2 + 1 ⇒ f(x) := x^2 + 1
