not not p ⇒ not(not(p))
p implies q implies r ⇒ implies(p, implies(q, r))
p ⟹ q or r ⇒ implies(p, or(q, r))
p and q implies r ⇒ implies(and(p, q), r)
x < 1 and y > 2 ⇒ and(x < 1, y > 2)
x ∈ A or x ∈ B ⇒ or(x in A, x in B)
x -> p and q ⇒ x -> and(p, q)
x = not p ⇒ x = not(p)
